No third-party or vendor SDK material is included in this repository.

This project distributes source code only. It contains no model weights, no
document-classification catalog, no binaries, and no data extracted from or
derived from any commercial identity SDK. Users must supply their own models,
in ONNX format, from a source they are licensed to use. The expected directory
layout, model contracts, and manifest schema are documented in docs/models.md.

The sample images under examples/ and the test catalog under tests/fixtures/
are generated by the scripts in tools/. They depict no real person and encode
no real credential: the holder, the issuing state (ZZT, in the ISO 3166-1
user-assignable range) and every document and credential number are fabricated.
